{"id":"G5273","lemma":"ὑποκριτής","transliteration":"hupokritēs","sayIt":"hupokritēs","language":"Greek","partOfSpeech":"noun, masculine","gloss":"hypocrite","meaning":"ὑπο-κριτής, -οῦ, ὁ\n(ὑποκρίνομαι, which see) [in LXX Job.34:30 36:13 (חָנֵף) * ;]\n1. one who answers, an interpreter (Plat.).\n2. a stage player, actor (Plut., Xen., al.). Metaphorical (in LXX and NT), a pretender, dissembler, hypocrite: Mat.6:2, 5 6:16 7:5 15:7 22:18 23:13-15 24:51, Mrk.7:6 Luk.6:42 12:56 13:15.†\n(AS)","glosses":["hypocrites","hypocrite"],"count":17,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"mat-6","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"hypocrites","kjv":"the hypocrites"}},{"chapterId":"mat-6","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"hypocrites","kjv":"the hypocrites"}},{"chapterId":"mat-6","v":16,"renderings":{"bsb":"hypocrites","kjv":"the hypocrites"}},{"chapterId":"mat-7","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"You hypocrite","kjv":"Thou hypocrite"}},{"chapterId":"mat-15","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"You hypocrites","kjv":"Ye hypocrites"}},{"chapterId":"mat-22","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"You hypocrites"}},{"chapterId":"mat-23","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"you hypocrites","kjv":"hypocrites"}},{"chapterId":"mat-23","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"you hypocrites","kjv":"hypocrites"}},{"chapterId":"mat-23","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"you hypocrites","kjv":"hypocrites"}},{"chapterId":"mat-23","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"you hypocrites","kjv":"hypocrites"}},{"chapterId":"mat-23","v":27,"renderings":{"bsb":"you hypocrites","kjv":"hypocrites"}},{"chapterId":"mat-23","v":29,"renderings":{"bsb":"you hypocrites","kjv":"hypocrites"}},{"chapterId":"mat-24","v":51,"renderings":{"bsb":"hypocrites","kjv":"the hypocrites"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-7","v":6,"renderings":{"bsb":"hypocrites","kjv":"hypocrites"}},{"chapterId":"luk-6","v":42,"renderings":{"bsb":"You hypocrite","kjv":"Thou hypocrite"}},{"chapterId":"luk-12","v":56,"renderings":{"bsb":"You hypocrites","kjv":"Ye hypocrites"}},{"chapterId":"luk-13","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"You hypocrites","kjv":"T